<title>USA: Northern States Power in agreement.</title>
<headline>Northern States Power in agreement.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Northern States Power Co said on Friday that it and CellNet Data Systems Inc of San Carlos, Calif. signed an agreement under, which CellNet will provide its fixed wireless information network to Northern States.</p>
<p>The agreement makes Northern States the nation's first major utility to integrate electric meters, gas meters and distribution automation into a single data collection network, connecting more than one million electric and gas meters in the Minneapolis/St. Paul area.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
